        <description>The Department of War is actively engaged in various activities, including military operations, personnel changes, technological advancements, and cultural events. The Department of War is increasing hostile fire pay and imminent danger pay for the first time since 2002. The Department of War has also launched a cybersecurity awareness campaign and is focusing on the impact of AI in the acquisition landscape. The Department of War is also increasing two hazard pays for the first time in nearly quarter century.</description>
